msgstr ""
"Curva per Angolare utilizzando una curva a forma d'arco, 7 ripetizioni e "
"Ammassata per Radiale, con quantità ammassata : -5,0."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/spray_brush_engine.rst:114
msgid "Gaussian for Radial, with Standard Deviation: 25."
msgstr "Gaussiana per Radiale, con deviazione standard: 25."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/spray_brush_engine.rst:115
msgid "Gaussian for Radial, with Standard Deviation: 50."
msgstr "Gaussiana per Radiale, con deviazione standard: 50."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/spray_brush_engine.rst:116
msgid "Gaussian for Radial, with Standard Deviation: 80."
msgstr "Gaussiana per Radiale, con deviazione standard: 80."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/spray_brush_engine.rst:121
msgid "Spray Shape"
msgstr "Forma a spruzzo"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/spray_brush_engine.rst:123
msgid ""
"If activated, this will generate a special particle. If not, the brush-tip "
"will be the particle."
msgstr ""
"Se attivata, genera una particella speciale. Se non è attivata, la punta del "
"pennello è la particella."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/spray_brush_engine.rst:126
msgid "Can be..."
msgstr "Può essere..."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/spray_brush_engine.rst:128
msgid "Ellipse"
msgstr "Ellisse"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/spray_brush_engine.rst:129
msgid "Rectangle"
msgstr "Rettangolo"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/spray_brush_engine.rst:130
msgid "Anti-aliased Pixel"
msgstr "Pixel con anti-aliasing"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/spray_brush_engine.rst:131
msgid "Pixel"
msgstr "Pixel"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/spray_brush_engine.rst:132
msgid "Shape"
msgstr "Forma"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/spray_brush_engine.rst:132
msgid "Image"
msgstr "Immagine"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/spray_brush_engine.rst:134
msgid "Width & Height"
msgstr "Larghezza e altezza"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/spray_brush_engine.rst:135
msgid "Decides the width and height of the particle."
msgstr "Decide larghezza e altezza della particella."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/spray_brush_engine.rst:136
msgid "Proportional"
msgstr "Proporzionale"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/spray_brush_engine.rst:137
msgid "Locks Width & Height to be the same."
msgstr "Blocca la proporzione tra larghezza e altezza."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/spray_brush_engine.rst:139
msgid "Texture"
msgstr "Trama"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/spray_brush_engine.rst:139
msgid "Allows you to pick an image for the :guilabel:`Image shape`."
msgstr ""
"Ti consente di prelevare un'immagine per la :guilabel:`Forma dell'immagine`."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/spray_brush_engine.rst:144
msgid "Shape Dynamics"
msgstr "Dinamica delle forme"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/spray_brush_engine.rst:146
msgid "Random Size"
msgstr "Dimensione casuale"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/spray_brush_engine.rst:147
msgid ""
"Randomizes the particle size between 1x1 px and the given size of the "
"particle in brush-tip or spray shape."
msgstr ""
"Rende casuale la dimensione della particella tra 1x1 px e la dimensione "
"specificata nella punta del pennello o nella forma dello spruzzo."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/spray_brush_engine.rst:148
msgid "Fixed Rotation"
msgstr "Rotazione fissa"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/spray_brush_engine.rst:149
msgid "Gives a fixed rotation to the particle to work from."
msgstr "Attribuisce alla particella una rotazione fissa con cui lavorare."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/spray_brush_engine.rst:150
msgid "Randomized Rotation"
msgstr "Rotazione casuale"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/spray_brush_engine.rst:151
msgid "Randomizes the rotation."
msgstr "Rende casuale la rotazione."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/spray_brush_engine.rst:152
msgid "Follow Cursor Weight"
msgstr "Segui peso cursore"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/spray_brush_engine.rst:153
msgid ""
"How much the pressure affects the rotation of the particles. At 1.0 and high "
"pressure it'll seem as if the particles are exploding from the middle."
msgstr ""
"Quanto la pressione influenza la rotazione delle particelle. Al valore di "
"1,0 e pressione elevata sembra come se le particelle esplodano dal centro."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/spray_brush_engine.rst:155
msgid "Angle Weight"
msgstr "Peso angolo"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/spray_brush_engine.rst:155
msgid "How much the spray area angle affects the particle angle."
msgstr ""
"Quanto l'angolo dell'area dello spruzzo influenza l'angolo delle particelle."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/spray_brush_engine.rst:160
msgid "Color Options"
msgstr "Opzioni del colore"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/spray_brush_engine.rst:162
msgid "Random HSV"
msgstr "HSV casuale"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/spray_brush_engine.rst:163
msgid ""
"Randomize the HSV with the strength of the sliders. The higher, the more the "
"color will deviate from the foreground color, with the direction indicating "
"clock or counter clockwise."
msgstr ""
"Rende casuale l'HSV (Hue/Saturation/Value) tramite i cursori. Più il valore "
"è elevato, più il colore si scosterà dal colore di primo piano, con la "
"direzione che indica il senso orario o antiorario."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/spray_brush_engine.rst:164
msgid "Random Opacity"
msgstr "Opacità casuale"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/spray_brush_engine.rst:165
msgid "Randomizes the opacity."
msgstr "Rende casuale l'opacità."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/spray_brush_engine.rst:166
msgid "Color Per Particle"
msgstr "Colore per particella"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/spray_brush_engine.rst:167
msgid "Has the color options be per particle instead of area."
msgstr "Gestisce le opzioni del colore per particella anziché per area."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/spray_brush_engine.rst:168
msgid "Sample Input Layer."
msgstr "Campiona livello d'ingresso."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/spray_brush_engine.rst:169
msgid ""
"Will use the underlying layer as reference for the colors instead of the "
"foreground color."
msgstr ""
"Utilizza il livello soggiacente come riferimento per i colori anziché il "
"colore di primo piano."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/spray_brush_engine.rst:170
msgid "Fill Background"
msgstr "Riempi sfondo"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/spray_brush_engine.rst:171
msgid "Fills the area before drawing the particles with the background color."
msgstr "Riempie l'area col colore di sfondo prima di disegnare le particelle."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/spray_brush_engine.rst:173
msgid ""
